        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Hamilton CH-112-BN Brushed Nickel Double Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis double pronged hook is made out of solid brass with a brushed nickel finish. The prongs are spaced widely enough apart to allow for easy access to either of the hook's halves without disturbing the other. Easily installed with the two wood screws that come packed with it.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/hami-ch-112-size.jpg?v=1704442259\" width=\"200\" height=\"223\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Hamilton CH-112 Hook Dimensions\"></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Hamilton Wall Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Nickel</b></li>\r\n<li>Prong Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Height: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/coat-and-hat-hooks\">Wall Hooks</a></b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\n</b>\r\n</p>",
